WEBVTT

00:02.327 --> 00:04.287
Habari za hivi punde. Gundua Mizu Kappa.

00:04.287 --> 00:06.397
Ni mradi wa sarafu za kidijitali wenye matumaini makubwa.

00:06.397 --> 00:07.957
Nunua kabla hujachelewa.

00:11.455 --> 00:13.845
Na ugundue kile ambacho mfumo wake unatoa.

00:18.423 --> 00:20.513
Lo, thamani ya Mizu Kappa tayari inapanda kwa kasi.

00:20.893 --> 00:23.533
Hii ni ajabu. Waliopuuza fursa hii hakika watalia.

00:23.951 --> 00:25.861
Walionunua mapema tayari wanapata faida.

00:26.541 --> 00:28.211
Hongereni mnaoendelea kushikilia sarafu.

00:28.981 --> 00:30.731
Huu ndio mpango wetu wa kustaafu.

00:32.658 --> 00:34.028
Mizu Kappa.

00:35.738 --> 00:37.288
Chunguza maono yake.

00:38.078 --> 00:39.698
Gundua matumizi yake.
